{"product_id":"a-child-s-first-library-of-values-volumes-1-to-15-total-development-program","title":"A Child’s First Library of Values – Volumes 1 to 15 (Total Development Program)","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"85\" data-end=\"461\"\u003eThere are books that teach children to read — and then there are books that teach them \u003cem data-start=\"172\" data-end=\"185\"\u003ehow to live\u003c\/em\u003e.\u003cbr data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"189\"\u003eA Child’s First Library of Values is part of ETL’s famous Total Development Program — a beautifully illustrated, heartwarming 15-volume collection that helps children discover kindness, honesty, courage, respect, and empathy through timeless stories from around the world.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"827\"\u003eEach book tells a short, value-driven tale, perfectly written for curious young minds and early readers. From tales of honesty that make you smile, to gentle reminders about sharing and helping others, this series builds character one story at a time. It’s not just a reading set — it’s a childhood companion that shapes the way kids think, feel, and treat others.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"1092\"\u003eIdeal for bedtime stories, classroom reading, or family bonding moments, these books make learning values a joyful adventure. The vibrant illustrations, simple language, and thoughtful morals make it easy for children to relate, reflect, and grow with every page.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1117\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1119\"\u003eComplete 15-volume collection covering essential moral values\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eCarefully curated stories that nurture empathy, honesty, kindness, and gratitude\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1345\" data-start=\"1268\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1345\" data-start=\"1270\"\u003eEasy-to-read text and captivating illustrations for children aged 3 to 10\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1346\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1416\" data-start=\"1348\"\u003eDeveloped by ETL Learning as part of the Total Development Program\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1493\" data-start=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1493\" data-start=\"1419\"\u003eGreat for family reading time, classrooms, and early character education\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese aren’t just storybooks — they’re stepping stones toward raising confident, compassionate, and thoughtful children\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809400250521,"sku":"3RA324568","price":300.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_08dd6791-0b9f-4703-8e1f-17d349d3a596.jpg?v=1761057334","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/a-child-s-first-library-of-values-volumes-1-to-15-total-development-program","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}